            "description": {
              "value": "You telegraph your next attack to let your allies in on your strategy. Make a melee or ranged Strike with a \u22122 circumstance penalty. On a hit, the next ally to target the same creature with a Strike gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their attack roll. On a critical hit, the bonus applies to any allies who act before the start of your next turn."
